<title>USA: Sioux City hogs up $1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs up $1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was active. Compared with Wednesday, barrows and gilts were $1.50 higher. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     54.75-55.00</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     54.00-54.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     52.50-54.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     50.50-52.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $47.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs     42.50</p>
<p>		 400-450 lbs     44.00</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs     46.00</p>
<p>		 500-550 lbs     47.00</p>
</text>
